  "body_html": "<h1>Correlated Equilibrium Exists In Finite Games</h1>\n<p>Every finite strategic-form game has at least one correlated equilibrium.</p>",
  "proof_html": "<p>Sketch</p>\n<p>By Nash's theorem, every finite strategic-form game has a mixed Nash\nequilibrium. Theorem 8.7 turns that mixed Nash equilibrium into a correlated\nequilibrium by using the induced product distribution on pure strategy profiles.</p>",
